  <item>
    <title>8. 直升机俯瞰南极大陆，零下的海水中我做了什么？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68396dde31215eb506886293</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68396dde31215eb506886293</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 30 May 2025 08:46:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾：哈比比 - solo女背包客，环球旅行者，目前环球旅行已满一年。</span></p><span></span><p><span>收听时长：57分钟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="67">01:07</a> 哈比比最近半年的行程概况</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="318">05:18</a> 拉美半年的高光时刻——南极</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="605">10:05</a> 南极船票价位区间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="785">13:05</a> 在乌斯怀亚蹲last minite船票到底靠谱吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="980">16:20</a> 不同类型南极邮轮不同的路线和行程安排</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1435">23:55</a> 在南极跳海仿佛经历了一次重生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1850">30:50</a> 坐在直升机副驾俯瞰南极大陆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2170">36:10</a> 对人类和生活的反思</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a> 南极邮轮上的暖心小事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2580">43:00</a> 邮轮上的科普讲座都有哪些主题？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2920">48:40</a> 邮轮上的社交</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3010">50:10</a> 哈比比给计划去南极朋友的建议</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期亮点</span></p><span></span><p><span>❄️ 南极直升机体验 - 坐在副驾驶位俯瞰南极大陆的震撼视角</span></p><span></span><p><span>🏊‍♀️ 南极跳水挑战 - 在极地海水中的勇敢尝试</span></p><span></span><p><span>🗺️ 一手南极攻略 - 从旅行规划到实用建议的全方位分享</span></p><span></span><p><span>📸 难忘瞬间 - 那些只有亲历者才能分享的珍贵故事</span></p><span></span><p><span>实用信息</span></p><span></span><p><span>📍 南极旅行最佳时间窗口</span></p><span></span><p><span>💰 预算规划要点</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎒 装备清单建议</span></p><span></span><p><span>🚢 选择合适的南极游轮线路</span></p>]]></description>
