    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾：李姐</span></p><span></span><p><span>前地质专业硕士，现某五百强央企保险经纪人</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号/小红书：李坚强碎碎念</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiPNMi280PuNkfmM15EpI6KuzJ-1.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>关键词：地质勘探 → 央企后台 → 全职保险经纪 | 职业转型实战派</span></p><span></span><p><span>收听指北</span></p><span></span><p><span>⛏️ 适合人群：迷茫大学生/想转行的打工人/保险行业好奇者</span></p><span></span><p><span>⏰ 时长：60分钟</span></p><span></span><p><span>Shownotes：</span></p><span></span><p><span>开场：地质锤与保单的碰撞</span></p><span></span><p><span>大学篇：背着地质锤的青春</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔍 专业选择真相</span></p><span></span><p><span>家族几代石油人的“血脉压制”</span></p><span></span><p><span>📈 读研觉醒时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span>转型第一跳：闯入央企保险后台</span></p><span></span><p><span>💼 入行神操作</span></p><span></span><p><span>简历零经验却拿下offer</span></p><span></span><p><span>叛逆第二跳：撕掉央企工牌当经纪</span></p><span></span><p><span>⚠️ 行业暴击真相</span></p><span></span><p><span>灵魂三问：“你专业是地质的？/返多少佣金？/理赔时会不会跑路？”</span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span>💡 给转型者的热鸡汤</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵 本期BGM</span></p><span></span><p><span>周深《旅途》</span></p><span></span><p><span>任素汐《枕着光的她》</span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span>👉 订阅《地球切片坊》，佛系不定期更新</span></p>]]></description>
