  <item>
    <title>2. 迪拜往事 重生之我在迪拜当乞丐</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6713b4eddb2cf82757661716</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6713b4eddb2cf82757661716</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 19 Oct 2024 13:32:27 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎回到午夜DJ的地球切片坊，这是一档记录人生经历的播客。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期是第二期，我和在迪拜共事过的原同事Lucy一起聊聊疫情期间在迪拜工作的趣事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="91">01:31</a> 节目简介</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="170">02:50</a> 嘉宾介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="380">06:20</a> 迪拜科普，如何从一个渔村发展成闻名世界的大都市</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="662">11:02</a> 穆斯林世界中的叛徒？可以喝酒吃猪肉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="721">12:01</a> 迪拜如何发展其它高端行业？用免税积极引进外资和人才&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">13:00</a> 发展靠外劳，印巴人群的工作和收入如何？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="986">16:26</a> 重生之我在迪拜当乞丐？打咩！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1048">17:28</a> 迪拜皇室有多奢华</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1137">18:57</a> 迪拜的shopping mall，奢侈品天堂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1468">24:28</a> 迪拜中产画像</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1697">28:17</a> 本地人的收入水平？重生之我在阿联酋娶四个老婆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1942">32:22</a> 电闸人群对迪拜的影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2134">35:34</a> 迪拜置业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2260">37:40</a> 迪拜的水电费高到离谱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2387">39:47</a> 美食之都，好餐厅大推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2802">46:42</a> 超高性价比水舞秀《La perle》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2975">49:35</a> 小众景点推荐：迪拜奇迹花园</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3093">51:33</a> 玩一玩打个卡推荐：游船早晚餐，租游艇，跳伞，冲沙，棕榈岛观景”The View“</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3178">52:58</a> 历史人文爱好者不要错过，迪拜老城德拉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3223">53:43</a> 黄金市场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3295">54:55</a> 香水、香薰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3405">56:45</a> 小众景点推荐：迪拜六国城</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3571">59:31</a> Lucy私藏景点，最爱的区域SOAK</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3720">1:02:00</a> 结语&amp;下期预告</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3820">1:03:40</a> Rashed Al Majed "Dubai Kawkab Aakhar"</span></p>]]></description>
